==============================================================================
INTERPRETATION
==============================================================================
A support-3 endpoint collision is not automatically a literal triangle in the parent merged arc-flip graph.  The induced edge count records whether the ternary residual is visible as adjacency geometry or only as endpoint-transfer incidence.
